WEBVTT

1
00:00:30,260 --> 00:00:31,460
Any news about Shen Niannian?

2
00:00:42,350 --> 00:00:44,910
Shen Nian, what were you doing when you were trapped by the fish?

3
00:00:45,820 --> 00:00:47,540
Tell us all your circumstances at that time

4
00:00:49,000 --> 00:00:51,080
Nothing told me at that time

5
00:00:51,720 --> 00:00:53,200
I was on the lifeboat

6
00:00:53,570 --> 00:00:55,730
I was afraid and kept following her

7
00:00:56,090 --> 00:00:59,460
Otherwise, I would have met Sister Shayu

8
00:01:00,100 --> 00:01:01,340
My sister was killed

9
00:01:04,360 --> 00:01:05,960
Since you're driving a lifeboat

10
00:01:06,620 --> 00:01:11,500
Why didn't you go up and save her in time?

11
00:01:11,940 --> 00:01:14,460
The lifeboat engine broke down on me

12
00:01:14,900 --> 00:01:16,320
I'm too scared

13
00:01:16,480 --> 00:01:18,390
I can only try my best to get it back

14
00:01:18,630 --> 00:01:24,390
Thinking about finding someone to save my sister quickly?

15
00:01:32,150 --> 00:01:33,070
I was her

16
00:01:33,070 --> 00:01:37,290
My sister’s accident is not cold yet

17
00:01:37,490 --> 00:01:38,600
die in the sea

18
00:01:42,980 --> 00:01:44,740
Pearl almost died in that place

19
00:01:44,900 --> 00:01:46,780
Why are you so crazy, Xiao Mo?

20
00:01:47,620 --> 00:01:49,460
Pearl was so frightened

21
00:01:49,860 --> 00:01:51,140
My spirit is almost broken.

22
00:01:51,710 --> 00:01:54,480
Don't force her, Brother Mo

23
00:01:55,420 --> 00:01:57,260
My sister and I have a deep love for each other

24
00:01:57,660 --> 00:01:59,340
I would rather it be me who dies

25
00:01:59,990 --> 00:02:01,150
If you doubt me

26
00:02:01,710 --> 00:02:03,270
I will die for you now

27
00:02:03,430 --> 00:02:20,190
What is the best thing to check for the lifeboat when going to find your sister?

28
00:02:20,350 --> 00:02:21,390
Find out who rented it

29
00:02:21,510 --> 00:02:22,790
Find out when you went to sea

30
00:02:22,990 --> 00:02:25,670
And all the navigation trajectory and positioning data of that ship

31
00:02:25,950 --> 00:02:27,150
Check it all out for me

32
00:02:27,270 --> 00:02:28,390
Shen Zhenzhu’s words

33
00:02:28,870 --> 00:02:30,150
I don't believe a word of it
